WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.336
Once a symbol of Beijing's goodwill.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:06.139
Now the center of angry debate in China.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:07.440
This panda

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.175
in Memphis, Tennessee, has become

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:09.809
the latest

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.379
victim in worsening US-China tensions.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.315
Yaya arrived in America

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.717
with her playmate, Leila, two decades ago

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:18.752
as an emblem

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.488
of growing bilateral friendship.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:22.622
But recent videos

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.557
showing the once fluffy panda

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.125
now looking

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.060
skinny with scraggly fur

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.262
has sparked outrage in China.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.330
Many Chinese people

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.931
and some animal advocates

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.134
are accusing the zoo of mistreatment.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:34.901
Just 4000

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.302
more videos on Chinese

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.470
social media claiming

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.706
the pandas are being abused quickly.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.640
Went viral.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.409
Against the backdrop of growing

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.344
anti-American sentiment.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.512
The rumors are often

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:49.182
fanned by state propaganda

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.451
And meanwhile, Chinese social media

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.552
users are praising

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.421
these viral videos of this panda

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.221
in Russia.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.156
Wu Yi

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.857
claiming videos of the active

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:58.391
and playful

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.192
panda prove

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.994
Russia is taking excellent

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.896
care of the Chinese bear.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:03.630
State TV

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.898
saying the pandas are helping

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:05.432
the Russia

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.933
China relationship

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.369
via Chinese and American scientists

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.171
launched a joint investigation

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.740
concluding that Yaya has a genetic fur

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.341
and skin condition

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.944
that does not impact her quality of life

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.280
and has received excellent care.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.949
But that message is not getting through.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.517
Outside the panda

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.252
exhibit at the Beijing Zoo.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.121
I asked people if they've heard of other

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:29.522
the panda firming up.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:30.590
This man says,

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.826
yes, she's abused in America.

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:34.027
Was he's an 11 year

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.162
old boy tells me I heard the U.S.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:38.098
is treating the panda poorly.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:39.933
This man says, isn't Russia

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.734
taking good care of pandas?

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.403
Pandas are happy over there.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.871
Not like in the U.S..

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.040
And this man

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.842
with his granddaughter tells me

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.877
pandas in Russia are very happy.

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.246
Why Russians and Chinese are friends.

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.249
At least Russia is not sanctioning China.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.618
Georgia will soon settle in this

00:01:58.818 --> 00:01:59.619
Beijing zoo.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:01.488
Now, China has long used its pandas

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:02.822
as a diplomatic tool.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:03.323
Currently,

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.190
its pandas are loaned

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.658
to about 20 countries.

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.193
The United States has not received

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.662
one since yogurt in LA 20 years ago.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.865
Now, these pandas are normally loaned

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.299
on these ten year leases

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.835
and they cost $1,000,000 annually.

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.804
The Memphis Zoo had already planned

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:18.671
to send Yaya

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.172
and Lola

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.573
back to Beijing this spring

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:22.442
because their lease is expiring.

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.210
But Lula died of heart disease

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.913
two months ago at the age of 24.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.848
The average lifespan for pandas

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.984
is usually under 30 years.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.853
Yet that didn't stop rampant speculation

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.122
and led to an explosion of accusations

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.357
about yoga's treatment.

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:40.360
To accelerating course to bring Yahya

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.327
back to China.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:43.763
The message

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:44.898
featured on billboards

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:45.865
from New York City

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:49.802
to major cities across China in 1972

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:50.436
during U.S.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:51.638
President Richard Nixon's

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:53.273
historic trip to China.

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:55.408
His wife visited pandas in Beijing

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:56.442
on behalf

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.012
of the people of the United States.

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:02.248
I am pleased to be here and accept

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:03.950
the precious gift.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.751
Months later,

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:06.252
China sent a pair of pandas

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.688
to the National Zoo in Washington, D.C..

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:10.690
Now, decades later,

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.492
this pandas returned from the U.S.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:13.359
to China.

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:15.862
Symbolic not of growing friendship,

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.564
but growing animosity.

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:20.567
Between two global superpowers, China.

